    <rdf:li xml:lang='x-default'>This file is our Southern Maine Huskies athletics graphic with a transparent background.

This is a vector image and can be opened with Adobe Illustrator. 

To get the PDF version of this graphic, choose &quot;Original file&quot; when downloading. If you choose a JPG option, the graphic will download with a white background.</rdf:li>
